+Acceptance evidence MUST distinguish unit/contract tests, runtime facts, operator-interface observations, and unavailable guarantees for each delegated stage and operator surface (interactive, exec, app/IDE). The native path SHALL be demonstrated on the real host for successful delegation and a refused attempt, authorized and unauthorized writes, the scoped operational context evidence and selection observations, lifecycle visibility and the complete read-only review wave. Unproved stages MUST remain explicitly blocked with outstanding acceptance tasks and MUST NOT count as completed replacement. Documentation SHALL describe the proven native path and refusal behavior without claiming Auto or changing other clients.
